window.products.push({"id":320045,"name":"Camping Fan for Tent with LED Lantern Creiv 20000mAh Battery Powered Portable Fan - 270° Pivot, 4 Speeds Rechargeable Fan with Hanging Hook for Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yCO2NBHhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Work Long Lasted】: This high-capacity battery fan can work long time 16-58hs after being fully charged (depending on 4 wind speeds), 4 wind speeds adjustable, low noise and 3 levels of brightness can be adjustable, which 4 corners on the fan with bright led beads, with a total of 16 bright led beads. 【USB-C Quick Charge】: The camping fan built-in 20000mah high capacity battery can be rechargeable by usb-c fast charging(Charging time 8-9 hours, tested with 5V/3A charger).The fan and light are under the control of separate buttons, 4 indicators 25% 50% 75% and 100% showing the remaining battery, reminding you to charge in time to avoid the dilemma of running out of power when you camping or picnicking. 【Can be as a Power Bank】: 20000mAh high capacity battery camping fan not only a fan but also can be as used a power bank. It comes with a usb-c and usb-a port for charging your phone, iPad, and other smart devices, It is a good partner for emergencies on any occasion when you go camping, picnicking, fishing, etc. 【High-Quality Material & Wide Use】:The camping fan adopts sturdy and durable ABS material for anti-drop use. The camping fan with a foldable hook under the base can be a 360-degree adjustment, you can hang it on the camping tent, or branches, it has a stable base, also can put it on a desk/floor, eg: RV, tent, factory, industrial area, tool house, office, room, etc. 【Compact Size】: The camping fan designed compact and portable, the size is 8.62 x 4.02 x 10.16 inches. 【Best service】1-year warranty or 30-day money-back guarantee, 24hs on line service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yCO2NBHhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creiv","source_asin":"B0C48XMQPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C48XMQPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C48XMQPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
