window.products.push({"id":320130,"name":"Lot45 Butane Kitchen Torch, 1oz - Small Torch Lighters Butane Refillable Canister, Cooking Blow Torch for Big Flame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eUa72L0oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use the Lot45 Fire Torch Lighter Butane Cooking Torch Lighters to create a precise flame that directly heats objects of your choice. Ideal for caramelizing sugar atop creme brulee, searing a steak, roasting vegetables, and melting cheese. Butane fuel refillable culinary torch can also be used for brazing and soldering tasks, plumbing and electrical jobs, or jewelry-making and other crafting projects. You can light a fireplace, campfire, or cigar, as well. 1.2-ounce capacity provides a burn time of up to 35 minutes. Anti-flare design and long torch head ensure your hands stay a safe distance from the flame. This kitchen butane torch will work when held at any angle, even upside down. When not in use, cover the gas dial and trigger with included red cap for safekeeping. [Craft Culinary Masterpieces]: Brown lemon meringue, caramelize creme brulee, and glaze ham with the Lot45 Small Butane Torch Lighter 1oz Culinary Blow Torch; Handheld torch creates consistent, reliable flames when crafting home-cooked meals and creating restaurant dishes [Turn Up the Heat]: Butane lighter torch offers power and precision; Push trigger creates a spark for quick ignition, then the gas flow regulation knob adjusts the flame intensity from 1.25 to 5 inches (3.2 to 12.7cm); Kitchen blow torch can handle up to 2,370 degrees F (1298 C); Butane torch fuel not included [Refillable Design]: 5.4 x 2-inch refillable gas torch canister has a 1.2-ounce (35g) gas capacity; To refill, drain any previous gases then hold chef torch upside down; Insert long-nozzle butane gas canister into gas filling valve and fill slowly; Allow 5-10 minutes for gas to stabilize [Ideal for All Your Needs]: While designed as a culinary butane torch, this small blow torch can also be used as bartender torch lighters, butane soldering torches, or craft torch lighters; Provides continuous burn time for up to 35 minutes [Safety First]: Aluminum canister and steel nozzle ensures optimal safety and flame control while the nylon finish provides anti-slip grip for added security; 2.3-inch (5.8cm) angled butane torch head keeps your fingers away from flames; Attachable base creates a 2.9-inch (7.4cm) stand for extra stability California Residents Prop 65 warning:Products may contain a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer, birth defects or other reproductive harm. This product has a manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship for a period of ONE (1) YEAR from the date of original retail purchase. See our Seller Return Policy for more details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eUa72L0oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lot45","source_asin":"B08VFG8C5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VFG8C5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VFG8C5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
