window.products.push({"id":320139,"name":"Hand Mixer Electric,7-Speed Hand Mixer, Electric Hand mixer with 4 Stainless Steel Attachements (2 Dough Hook & 2 Beaters) + Turbo Button for Whip Cre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zsqiElD3L._AC_SL1146_.jpg","description":"Specifications of Electric Hand Mixer: Power: 100W Voltage: 110V Frequency: 50/60HZ Material: Stainless Steel, PVC Product Weight: 450g (0.992lb) Product Dimension: 18 * 5 * 12.5cm How to Use the Electric Hand Mixer When I Receive It? Step 1 - Push the beaters into slots, slightly turning until locking into proper position. Step 2 - Immerse the beaters into the food. Step 3 - Insert the plug to power the mixer on. Step 4 - Gradually slide the speed control switch from 1 to your desired speed. Step 5 - Slide the speed control switch to “OFF” position. Wait until the beaters stops and then unplug mixer. Which Speed Should I Choose to Stir Different Materials? 1-2 Grade: Mixing dry item such as flour and potatoes. 3-4 Grade: Mixing salad dressing and kneading dough. 5 Grade: Mixing cakes, cookies and simple bread dough material. 6 Grade: Mixing butter, sugar, beating uncooked candy, desserts and snacks. 7 Grade: Beating eggs, frosting , mashed potatoes , (milk fatty) gas-foaming with milk etc. What's in the Package? 1 * Electric Hand Mixer 1 * Operation Guide 2 * Dough Hooks 2 * Beaters","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zsqiElD3L._AC_SL1146_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WapoRich","source_asin":"B08XQD9VDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQD9VDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQD9VDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
