window.products.push({"id":320247,"name":"Pluralla Personal Fan, Portable Hanging Neck Fan, 3-5KmAh USB-C Rechargeable 5-Speed Modes Powerful Desktop Fan with Base, Max 16H Run Time, Adjustabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qp2bi9V9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❅ Small Size & Portable Fan ❅ Designed with the anti-slip handle, Pluralla personal fan is very easy and comfortable to hold even by small hands. Comes with a stable base and lanyard, you can put it on desk or hang it on you neck outdoor. The base includes a phone holder design, which is convenient for you to place your phone and watch movies and videos coolly. ❅ Powerful Wind - 5 Modes ❅ Built-in optimal copper DC motor, effectively reduce carbon brush friction noise, Pluralla portable fan provides 5 different wind speeds for you. You can simply press the power button to switch the wind setting, from weak to strong, powerful and quick enough to cool you down no matter indoor or outdoor. Special Note: In order to protect the motor to extend the service life and save energy, the fan will automatically shut down after continuous using for 4 hours. ❅ 4000mAh Rechargeable & USB-C Charging ❅ This mini fan built in 4000mAh rechargeable battery that can provide you up to 9-16 hours of continuous working time. Comes with the USB-C charging cable, you can charge it for about 4-5H by the regular socket, power bank, computer, etc. ❅ Smart LED Digital Display ❅ The digital display shows the gears that you choose and the real time power percentage which reminds you the time to charge. Digital display design, easy to check the power consumption at any time. Help you keep everything in control. ❅ Ideal Gift Choice & Packing List ❅ The designed out-looking is unique that would be an ideal gift for stylish girls, boys, men, women and kids. It's an ideal partner in such hot summer to keep you cool when traveling, waiting in line or doing sports. Package includes: 1 x Mini Portable Hand-held Fan; 1x Detachable Lanyard; 1x Stable Base; 1x USB A-C Cable; 1 x User Manual; 1 x Aromatherapy Tablet; 12-month Manufacture Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qp2bi9V9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluralla","source_asin":"B0C5M9G1CP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5M9G1CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5M9G1CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":320248,"name":"Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Food Thermometer with Dual Probe & Backlight & Magnet, Digital Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Kitchen, Deep Frying, Gril","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hki6tN81S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Designed Meat Thermometer PEMCLEN digital food thermometer is a perfect solution to achieve the most accurate temperature in a matter of seconds. Help you cook like a pro with this food thermometer every time. Make an ideal present for cooking lovers! Feature: √ Double Probes: A 180° Foldaway probe for meat, wire probe for grill. √Large & Clear Screen: Fast Response within 2-3s and easy to read on the bright lcd. √Hold Function :It could lock readouts when probe removed to protect your hands from heats. √ Alarm Function: Support the set temperature, when the meat reaches the required temperature, an alarm will be issued. √Easy to Storage: The thermometer also has a internal magnet and large hang hole so that it can be hanged up on kitchen hooks or stored up on the refrigerator. Auto Shut-Off Never worry about battery life! This electric meat thermometer automatically shuts off in 10 minutes. Specification: Temperature Range: -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C) Accuracy Range: ±0.9°F(±0.5°C) Probe Material: Food grade stainless steel probe Rotational Probe: 4.3in Long Probe:6.3in Long Probe Wire: 42 in Use Battery: CR2032H button battery, works to 500h Weight: 0.19 lbs Size: 6.5*2.2*0.66 in Warnings: 1. Do not touch hot probe with bare hands. 2. Do not expose the probe with open flame directly. 3. Do not leave the thermometer body in the oven while cooking. 4. Clean the meat thermometer with a wet cloth and dry thoroughly after every use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hki6tN81S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pemclen","source_asin":"B08VDMVGJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDMVGJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDMVGJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
