window.products.push({"id":320284,"name":"Chooone Instant Read Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Meat Temperature Thermometer with Backlight & Calibration, Digital Cooking Food Meat Candy Thermome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxwKMbkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MOTION SENSING SLEEP/WAKE】Meat thermometer probe with foldable 4.6 inches food grade stainless steel probe, directly turns on and off by the probe opens or closes; instantly wakes when picked up the digital food thermometer and sleeps when fold the probe to save battery power; up to 3000 hours with included 3A battery. 【100% WATERPROOF & DURABILITY】High-quality waterproof eco-friendly plastic with IP65 certification, so the waterproof meat thermometer can still be used in the environment of steam and running water, and it also facilitates cleaning. (NOTE: Please wipe it with a soapy cloth or rinse it to clean, and DO NOT soak it or put it in a dishwasher). The housing is highly durable and resilient, can withstand accidental drops or other impact accidents. Perfect for outdoor grilling. 【ULTRA FAST AND ACCURATE】Takes a temperature in a little as 2-3 seconds, and is accurate to ±0.5°C with a wide range of -58℉-572℉(-50°C- 300°C). No more waiting over a hot stove or grill for the temperature to settle. Find out the exact temperature of your food in a second! And the Grill meat thermometer set the \"HOLD\" button, you can lock the current temperature, easy to view from a close distance. 【2.0 LARGE BACKLIT DISPIAY】Cooking thermometer features backlight LCD, Whether you can see clearly in the harsh light of day or outdoors in the dark of night. Magnetic back to allow you to easily attach to refrigerator or any metal surface and a hang hole for your kitchen hooks or a lanyard. 【GOOD PRODUCTS AND SERVICE】Digital thermometer are versatile and perfect for grilling, baking, deep frying, making candy, Liquid, Steak, ice cubes, coffee, milk, soup, etc. Our products are subject to strict quality control, please feel free to use. Please feel free to contact us via Amazon directly if you have any questions or need any help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dxwKMbkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chooone","source_asin":"B0B7B641LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7B641LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7B641LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
