window.products.push({"id":320299,"name":"Oasis Supply, Quilon® Parchment Paper Baking Liner Sheets, Unbleached Brown Pan Liners, Half and Full Sheet Sizes (100, Half Sheet 12\" x 16\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qUb9mC3DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Great for bakeries, cafes, and restaurants, this coated parchment paper expedites cleanup and helps you maintain an environmentally friendly establishment. Environmentally-friendly Material In order to serve as a \"green\" solution for all your baking needs, this full size pre-cut pan liner is made of grease- and moisture-resistant 24.5# paper. Its natural, unbleached paper does not require chlorine or other harsh chemicals to create its color, unlike standard white pan liners. Quilon Coatingl Featuring a Quilon coating, this pan liner creates a stick-resistant surface which helps reduce food waste, and it eliminates the need to use spray-on release products on your bun/sheet pan. Because this sheet liner protects your pan from grease build up, a limited amount of water is required for washing, ultimately making your pan remarkably easy and quick to clean. Convenient, Efficient, and Disposable For alternative uses, this liner can even be used to make disposable pastry bags, bake foods en papillote, or season foods in a parchment-made envelope. It also works great to line sheet pans for cookies and other baked goods. When you're ready to clean up, the liner is disposable, allowing you to simply throw it away and grab a new one!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qUb9mC3DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oasis Supply","source_asin":"B07PDJ5QS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PDJ5QS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PDJ5QS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
