window.products.push({"id":320436,"name":"7 Day Spell Breaker Prayer Candle for Hex, Spell Removal, Spiritual Healing Spell-Casting Witchcraft Wishing Manifestation Magical Positive Energy Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Pj+npOavL._AC_.jpg","description":"Spiritual Candles Our spiritual prayer candles come in several categories, including plain, prayer candles, saint candles, scented candles, horoscope candles, spiritual candles for love, spiritual candles for protection, spiritual candles for money and wealth, spiritual candles for positive energy, and more. Manifestation candles that can be used in a wide range of magical endeavors to assist with the certain goals that you’re seeking. Whether it’s personal protection, relationship, home, love, money, or family protection, the energy cleansing candles are believed to assist with the energies. Specific Goals - Intent your desire. The manifestation candle can be used in a wide range of magical endeavors, including spells and rituals. This candle will burn for approximately 240 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Pj+npOavL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Original Candle Company","source_asin":"B014D8DE84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014D8DE84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014D8DE84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":320437,"name":"Melange 40-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (French Riviera) | Service for 8 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup Bowl,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-05Hv+aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0% porosity for greater durability. - Complete set for service of 4 or 8. - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-05Hv+aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B01HXGC9RK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HXGC9RK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HXGC9RK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":320438,"name":"Penny & Rose Magnolia Diffuser | Penny Candy Oil Scent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G-nRGPanL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET CONTAINS: 4 Magnolia Diffusers and 2 Willow Branches, Special Edition Penny & Rose Seltzer-Inspired Bottle with Decorative Seltzer-Inspired Top and 6.7 oz / 200 ml Premium Fragrance Oil SCENT: PENNY CANDY | Fragrance Notes: Sugar, Mixed Fruit & Mischief. Each Penny and Rose scent is inspired by our family farm on Butternut Road and evoke memories near and dear to our hearts. 8 scent options available: Penny Candy, Roasted Maple 'Mallows, Summertime Spirits, Gram's Cran Cobbler, Farmhouse OJ, Lawn Chair Lemonade, Springhouse Watermelon & Morning Meadows (see our other listings). UNIQUE GIFT: Each floral bouquet is uniquely handcrafted and inspired by nature with thin, wooden petals that absorb and diffuse the oil beautifully throughout any room. NOSTALGIC UPCYCLE: Modeled after seltzer bottles from the 30s and 40s, our vintage-style bottle uniquely displays your bouquet and, with our custom designed seltzer bottle top, may be reused for soap, home decor, or anything your creative heart desires. LONGEVITY: Product will effectively diffuse scent for approximately 3 months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G-nRGPanL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PENNY AND ROSE","source_asin":"B07KCWRRVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCWRRVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCWRRVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
