window.products.push({"id":320510,"name":"Howard Miller 630-260 Bradley Mantel Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4099.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIHhn1TJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MANTEL CLOCK: Featuring a highly polished & buffed Windsor Cherry finish on fifteen different species of hardwoods and veneers, this Bradley Clock is limited edition and features a curved, beveled glass panel with the intricate working of brass movements for an aged look. The series number comes engraved on the front. DURABLE: Designed with Russian Walnut Burl on the Cherry case, this antique clock features a movingue border with ebony and maple accent lines and decorative inlays. A hinged door on the backside offers access to the movement and convenient winding key storage. CHIME MOVEMENT: This wood chime clock features a key-wound, triple-chime movement, playing Westminster, St. Michael, or Whittington ¼, ½, & ¾ chimes accordingly with full chime and strikes on the hour. An industry-exclusive dual-ratchet ensures safe movement winding. DIMENSIONS: This Howard Miller clock is designed with a height of 12.5 inches (32 cm), a width of 22.75 inches (58 cm), and a depth of 6.75 inches (17 cm). The key-wound, triple-chime movement comes with an automatic nighttime chime shut-off option. Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine, and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QIHhn1TJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B002KSQ2AM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002KSQ2AM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002KSQ2AM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
