window.products.push({"id":320530,"name":"Pastel Balloon Garland Kit - Macaron Balloon Arch Kit for Parties - Small and Large Balloons Gold Confetti Mint Pink Balloons - Balloon Column","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vp80wKZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mouthwatering Macarons! Everyone loves macarons! And now you can go macaron mad with your wedding, bridal shower or baby shower decorations thanks to this pastel garland balloon kit. Contains dreamy yellow, light green, mint, pastel blue, purple and pink balloons, plus festive gold confetti balloons and decorating tools! So, now you have the balloons, who’s bringing the macarons? Less pops and holes: Did you know the most high-grade balloons weigh 2 - 2.5grams? The numbers may not mean much, but the quality means those balloons are less likely to pop or contain holes. But our balloons are even thicker, 3 – 3.5 grams! They’re thicker and with greater color density but also the highest quality colored balloons you’ve seen today. Luxury quality for wedding decorations! what's in the kit? Along with all those luxury balloons you get the following: one sheet of glue dots, one balloon strip, a balloon tying tool, 2 rolls of fishing line, 3 balloon hooks to securely hang your garland and 1 balloon inflator. Plus, you get easy instructions to create the perfect garland backdrop for your event. Flowers, arches, garlands wreath or centerpiece – you can do it all! Balloon sizes and colors: Your order contains 36x 5” balloons, 24x 10” balloons, 18x 12” balloons and 12x 18” balloons. Each featuring an equal number of yellow, mint, light blue, pink, purple and green. You’ll also receive 6x 12” Clear Balloons with Gold Confetti (1cm confetti). The 96 blush balloons are divided by size and each in an individual pack, labelled so you can see everything easily at a glance. The Baby Nest Designs promise: Your kit comes with 96 assorted balloons, 14 accessories and manual, all carefully packed in a reusable box. When your balloons arch kit arrives, check it and tell us if anything is missing so we can replace it fast before your party. Unlike other kits, you’ll love being able to hang your garland using our 3 hooks – so go ahead and enjoy your pastel party decor, or we’ll refund every cent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Vp80wKZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baby Nest Designs","source_asin":"B07QG3YG1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QG3YG1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QG3YG1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
