window.products.push({"id":320581,"name":"Silicone Faucet Handle Drip Catcher Tray, Kitchen Sink Splash Guard Faucet Mat Behind Faucet Water Drying Mat Splash Guard for Sink Protectors for Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71inq2CLUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Drainage Design: The newly upgraded kitchen sink splash guard is designed with a slope, compared to some flat faucet mats that tend to accumulate water and breed bacteria, our silicone faucet handle drip catcher tray can flow smoothly down the slope as long as the water falls, keeping your countertop clean and tidy. Keep Countertop Dry: The wrap-around design kitchen faucet mat is perfect for your faucet base. Simply installing a faucet handle drip catcher on the faucet base to keep your sink area dry and clean without having to put up with water stains on your countertop or wipe down your sink countertop after each use of the faucet. Safe & Durable Silicone: Kitchen faucet drip catcher faucet mat is made of food grade silicone, safe and reliable, reusable, durable and easy to clean. It will not break or fade easily and can be reused for a long time. The silicone material makes it not only a sink splash guard, but also a placeholder for dry brushes and sponges. Adjustable Size Faucet Mat: The splash guard for sink measures 14.5\" x 5.51\" and fits faucets from 0.78-2.5 in diameter. The top of the splash guard has a collapsible area of about 1\" that you can use to adjust the size to fit your faucet area. Silicone faucet drip guards can be easily placed in kitchen sinks, bathrooms, farmhouses and RVs to keep countertop clean and dry. Kitchen Accessories Gifts: The perfect kitchen guard for faucet to add a practical, chic decoration to your kitchen. Let you relieve the burden of cleaning and free your hands. It's also a thoughtful gift to give to family and friends, perfect as a housewarming gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71inq2CLUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furniease","source_asin":"B0B14P4J7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B14P4J7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B14P4J7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
