window.products.push({"id":320781,"name":"Handmade Wooden Dough Bowl Candle Made with Soy Wax","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614oA43zgWL._SL1170_.jpg","description":"This hand carved wooden dough bowl soy candle is the perfect new home gift.  Each candle is hand poured in small batches. Every bowl is unique in shape. Our bowls are hand-carved and poured with 100% soy wax. This candle is approximately 10 x 6 x 2 and has approximately 16 ounces of wax inside.  - One Candle Per order - Each Bowl is Different and will have its own markings - Made to order  When the candle is gone just wipe clean with warm water and decorate as you please. Tips for Burning Candles: Burn for a minimum of 2 hours the first time you light the candle. Always place on a flat surface when burning. Trim wick between uses. Keep away from drafts - i.e. open windows, vents or fans","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614oA43zgWL._SL1170_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08GDSPH6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GDSPH6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GDSPH6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":320782,"name":"Throw Pillow Covers,Home Farmhouse Decorative,Pillowslip for Living Room,Bed,Sofa Double Sided Blue Green Inky Oil Painting Drops of Water White Dande","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T+CtE5mgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"4 Pack Oil Painting Arts Style Throw pillow covers FEATURES : 🌿 Hidden zipper design, invisible zipper design, easy to remove 🌿 Oil Painting Print Tree and Flower is unique . Help you to decorate your home in good taste 🌿 Best for any room decoration(bedroom, guest room, kids room, living room,Bed,Sofa and Car ect.) 🌿 These pillowcases are made of durable and environmentally friendly material, easy to clean and can be used for long periods. This will bring great convenience to your life. 🌿 Perfect decoration for home, sofa, bedroom, living room, office, coffee shop. It will beautify every place in your life and bring you a brand new nice mood . 🌿 With these comfortable and soft throw pillow covers,you can lay down on the sofa after a weary day while holding your favorite pillow. Accompanied by soothing music, gradually fell asleep. Give you endless comfort and security. Warm Tips 1. It is flat printing and the blurry printing is a kind of oil painting style, not a defect. Please DO note this before buying it. 2. All cushions are handmade,so please understand there may be 1-2cm deviation exist. 3. Due to lighting effects and monitor's brightness/contrast settings etc., the color tone of the website's photo and the actual item could be slightly different. 4. We suggest use 20\" insert to fulfill the pillowcase,so that the pillow will looks more full,more beautiful. 5. Machine Wash Cold Separately, Gently Cycle Only, No Bleach, Tumble Dry Low, Do Not Iron, Low Temperature If Necessary. Size: (pack of 4)18X18 Inches(45.72x45.72cm) Materials: 1.The pillow cover is made of high quality flannelette blend material and is very durable, enviromentally friendly and very comfortable. 2.This cushion cover has an invisible zipper and all seams have been over-locked so it is easy to wash it. \"Add to Cart\" now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T+CtE5mgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEYDRT","source_asin":"B08ZYK9YLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYK9YLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYK9YLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
