window.products.push({"id":320828,"name":"THREAD SPREAD 100% Organic Cotton Bed Sheet Set - Crisp and Cooling Percale Weave, Soft Breathable, Eco-Friendly, 4 Piece Bedding Set, Deep Pocket wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MSoPNy1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 100% GOTS-CERTIFIED ORGANIC COTTON SHEET SET: Switch to organic sheets king size that are GOTS & OEKO-TEX certified, which means they’re chemical-free, earth-friendly, and safe for your skin. These organic cotton sheets king size are great for the environment. They take less water to grow, reduce carbon footprint, and produce lesser greenhouse emissions. Crisp, smooth, and natural—these cotton sheets for king size bed are made for eco-conscious people who want quality bedding. ❄ CRISP & COOL + LIGHT & AIRY SHEETS: These light, crisp, and soft 300 thread count percale sheets king size stay put for a long time. Unlike Egyptian, linen, or sateen bedsheets, these king size sheets cotton are naturally cooler, breathable, and more lightweight for better sleep in the summers. Hotel-lovers, take note: These cooling king sheets cotton are as luxurious as bamboo sheets with a slightly crinkled effect all over. Best for hot sleepers. 🛏 LET’S UNPACK THE SHEET SET: Our king size cotton sheets contains 4 piece: 1 Flat Sheet (108” W X 102” L), 1 Fitted Sheet (78” W X 80” L + 16” deep pockets), and 2 King-Sized Pillow Cases (21” W X 40” L). The fitted sheet has extra deep pockets and a thick elastic that goes all over and perfectly fits the adjustable mattress up to 18 inches. The head/foot side labels make it easier to do the bed. A well-stitched 5” hem keeps the flat sheets and pillow covers in shape. 💧 EASY HOME CARE & MAINTENANCE: Pass down our high-quality king cotton sheets to generations because these luxury sheets become softer with every wash. Our cotton king sheets are machine washable, unlike silk bedding, and they don’t require frequent washes like fleece bedding. Spin our cotton king size sheets set on a gentle cycle and use a plant-based laundry detergent. Avoid using whiteners; use only non-chlorine bleach. 💚 WE LOVE SUSTAINABILITY AT THREAD SPREAD: Pure organic cotton fabric a) needs less water to grow, b) is less polluting, and c) combats climate change. All our organic & natural bedding sets are inspected by third parties before packing them in an eco-friendly and recyclable box. Don’t like our premium cotton bed sheets king size? No worries. Get your money refunded or the product exchanged within 30 days of purchase as per Amazon guidelines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MSoPNy1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B0C69W65MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C69W65MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C69W65MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
