window.products.push({"id":320902,"name":"KES Hand Towel Stand Marble Base, Countertop Towel Stand 16.5\" Height, T-Shape Hand Towel Rack Stand for Bathroom, Towel Holder Weighted Base SUS304 S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WTvnp4VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal Sizes - Designed for Standard Hand Towels: The verticle hanging height of this towel rack stand is 16.5\" (419mm) and the crossbar is 10.5\" (266mm) long. The height is ideal for keeping standard hand towels that have a maximum length is 31\" (787mm) from touching the countertop. 5.5\" Compact Marble Base - Save Space & Keep Stable: The round marble base is 5.5\" (140mm) in diameter and fits compact countertops, so you can save space and keep your bathroom neat. Also, the base is heavy enough to keep the hand towel rack steady in daily use and resist tipping over. Natural Marble Base - Heavy-duty & Unique: The heavy marble base effectively keeps the towel rack from tipping over so it'll stand steadily when you access the towel. Also, the base is made of 100% natural marble which features a variety of colors and unique patterns. Ideal for different styles of bathrooms. Freestanding Design for Easy Installation - In A Minute: No drilling is needed. Won't damage the wall. It is easy enough to install on your own within a minute. Just need to tightly attach the heavy base to the T-bar with the included heavy-duty screw. You can move the countertop towel stand anywhere. Rustproof - SUS304 Stainless Steel & Marble Base: This towel stand for bathroom is composed of a SUS304 stainless steel T-bar and natural marble base, so the unit has good performance in resisting rust & corrosion. It is ideal for humid environments such as bathrooms, kitchens, balconies, and sauna rooms. EVA Anti-Slip Pads - Protect Your Countertop: KES provides self-adhesive pads to stick under the base, so the standing hand towel holder will not move out of place or slip. Moreover, the padded bottom can keep your countertop from scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WTvnp4VTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B09832WR24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-320902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09832WR24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09832WR24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
